  "name": "frisqueendom",
  "description": "Frisqueendom is a sophisticated 3D sports simulator centered on ultimate frisbee mechanics, utilizing a custom aerodynamic physics engine written in Rust and compiled to WebAssembly for high-performance flight calculations. The project integrates complex team AI behaviors, procedural skeletal animations, and a multi-layered career management system within a Three.js-based rendering environment. It supports local and LAN multiplayer via a custom relay protocol and features extensive automated testing for both physics integration and gameplay logic.",
